9,"(PDF) Performance and Aesthesis in Malay-World Musics, Religious and ...",https://www.academia.edu/77834531/Performance_and_Aesthesis_in_Malay_World_Musics_Religious_and_Secular,"Abstract: The endogenous religious and secular musics of the Malay World's various social formations display a range of performance manners and organisation that reflect their distinctive socio-cultural and religious orientations. This brief paper supplements the material in my chapter ""Music and the cline of Malayness"".","Malay, Berau",Austronesian
